  "prefLabel": "Agr 1201.01 Principal display panel",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 1201.01 “Principal display panel” means the out-facing side of the feed tag, or if no tag, the part of the label that is most likely to be displayed, presented, shown, or examined under normal and customary conditions of display for retail sale.\n\nSource. #12788, eff 5-23-19",
